// Expanded instrumental arrangement. The established melody keeps all pitches, onsets, written durations, rests, tempo and meter. Original plucked/keyboard accompaniment remains; independent low strings sustain its bass line and violin/viola voice its explicitly simultaneous harmonies. Common chord tones are tied, not reattacked. Characteristic festival percussion marks phrase/rhythmic structure. No choir is used. Standard GM/CC7=100; lead and accompaniment velocities balanced for the larger ensemble.
// Musicbox title: %E8%AD%89%E5%9F%8E%E5%AF%BA%E3%81%AE%E7%8B%B8%E5%9B%83%E5%AD%90
